(## 2\) Pattern 1: ReAct \(Reason + Act\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## What it is) Tj
T*
(ReAct alternates between:) Tj
T*
(1. reasoning about next action,) Tj
T*
(2. executing a tool/data action,) Tj
T*
(3. observing result,) Tj
T*
(4. repeating until final answer.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
