(## 6\) Practical recommendation for ThinkLife roadmap) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Keep **Plan-and-Execute** as default for safety-critical flows \(already production-ready) Tj
T*
(shape\).) Tj
T*
(2. Add **ReAct mode** for research/ops agents by wiring real tool execution in) Tj
T*
(`_execute_tools_node`.) Tj
T*
(3. Add **Self-Ask mode** by extending `WorkflowState` with `subquestions`, adding nodes:) Tj
T*
(   - `decompose_question`) Tj
T*
(   - `answer_subquestion`) Tj
T*
(   - `synthesize_answer`) Tj
T*
(4. Use `adaptive` planning strategy as default in new agents to combine speed + robustness.) Tj
T*
() Tj
